[0m[0m
Unchecked [38;5;10mscanf[0m return. [38;5;10mx[0m and [38;5;10my[0m stay at their initializers [38;5;10m1[0m and [38;5;10m1[0m when conversion fails, so empty input prints [38;5;10mquotient: 1, remainder: 0[0m rather than erroring. Partial input ([38;5;10m"42"[0m) leaves [38;5;10my == 1[0m. A hand-rolled scanner reproduces [38;5;10m%d[0m semantics: whitespace skipping across newlines, optional sign, decimal-only digits (so [38;5;10m0x10[0m yields [38;5;10m0[0m and leaves [38;5;10mx10[0m in the stream), one-byte pushback on the terminating character, and glibc's out-of-range handling — the field converts with [38;5;10mstrtol[0m saturation at [38;5;10mLONG_MAX[0m/[38;5;10mLONG_MIN[0m, then narrows to [38;5;10mint[0m. That is why [38;5;10m99999999999999999999[0m becomes [38;5;10m-1[0m and [38;5;10m4294967296[0m becomes [38;5;10m0[0m, matching the C exactly.[0m[0m
